  articleID: https://NUSA/Updates/Recents
  title: Ronald Dump Shot !
  headliner: <b>Presidential Contender Survives Second Assassination Attempt On Life</b>
  bodyText: "For the second time in just over two months, former N.U.S.A President
    Ronald Dump has escaped an assassination plot, this time after protective agents
    spotted a rifle barrel poking through the perimeter bushes of his West Palm Beach
    golf resort while he played the fifth hole. \r\n\r\nMore about this story :\r\n"
  externalLinkBodyText: "The close call follows the harrowing July rally shooting
    in Butler, Pennsylvania, where a rooftop sniper opened fire mid-speech, grazing
    Trump\u2019s upper right ear before he famously rose to his feet pumping his
    fist in defiance. In this latest incident, forward-scouting security officers
    immediately opened fire on the concealed suspect, forcing the gunman to drop
    his scoped rifle and flee the scene in a black SUV before state troopers intercepted
    him on a nearby highway."
  hasExternalLink: 1
  customComments:
  - HAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHAHA
  - "A man was shot and ya\u2019ll are laughing ?"
  - I don't like the guy, but violence ? really ?
  - "Well, third time's the charm I guess\u2026"
